{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12413","headline":"送李九贬南阳 · 钱起","name":"送李九贬南阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉柱金罍醉不欢，云山驿道向东看。\n鸿声断续暮天远，柳影萧疎秋日寒。\n霜降幽林沾蕙若，弦惊翰苑失鸳鸾。\n秋来回首君门阻，马上应歌行路难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}